# Dantooine (K1, danm13 the Jedi Enclave, danm14aa-ac the grounds and the
# grove, danm15 the ruins): the Council, the dream, the training, the
# Jedi Code, the crystal and the lightsaber, Juhani in the grove, the
# ruins' Star Map, the Council's four planets. Starts from the Taris
# escape's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough k1 @dantooine data/routes/k1/dantooine.route --god
to dan13_trig03          # the Council chamber: they consider your training
talk
module danm13            # the dream on the Ebon Hawk, back in the Enclave
to dan13_trig03          # the Council: the vision, the training
talk
talk                     # the training (k_player_dialog), Zhar's tests
talk
save dan_training
say continue my training # the Jedi Code (IGN's answers)
say ready for the tests
say there is peace
say there is knowledge
say there is serenity
say there is harmony
say there is the force
use dan13_zhar
talk
use dan13_dorak          # the crystal: a Jedi Guardian (AddMultiClass)
talk
use dan13_zhar           # the lightsaber built
talk
save dan_saber
say third trial          # the grove's taint
use dan13_zhar
talk
use dan13_jdroid         # the courtyard's droid opens the way out
exit dan13_door03
exit to14be              # the grounds to the grove
exit to14ce
save dan_grove
skill persuade=20        # Juhani beaten and talked back to the light by a
say [persuade] i have no desire to kill you  # persuasive build (as on
say [persuade] come now, juhani              # Manaan and Korriban): she
say [persuade] it is not your fault          # goes to the Council, and
say [persuade] do not worry, juhani          # joins the party there
say [persuade] of course it would
to dan14_juhani
fight 15                 # her ambush, the duel, her surrender and talk
fight 15
fight 25                 # the grove's kath hounds
exit to14be              # back to the Enclave
exit to14ae
exit man14aa_door03
use dan13_zhar           # Padawan
talk
use dan13_vandar         # the ruins of the dream
talk
save dan_padawan
exit dan13_door03
exit man14aa_door04      # the ruins
to dan15_trig01          # the ancient droid
talk
use RakataDoor1@2        # the life seal: Oceanic, Grassland, Arboreal
fight 20
say talk to the computer
say insert your datapad
say talk to the computer
say retrieve your datapad
say oceanic
say grassland
say arboreal
use dan15_compb
talk
use RakataDoor1@1        # the death seal: Desert, Volcanic, Barren
fight 20
say talk to the computer
say insert your datapad
say talk to the computer
say retrieve your datapad
say desert
say volcanic
say barren
use dan15_compw
talk
use man15_door03         # the sealed doors to the Star Map
use dan15_door05
to dan15_trig05
talk
save dan_starmap
exit man15_door02        # back to the Council: the four planets
exit man14aa_door03
to dan13_trig03
talk
save dan_council
